{"id":"297207ea3fca7fff","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-predicate-typed.md","title":"类型真理谓词 $T^n$","display":"df-truth-predicate-typed — 类型真理谓词 $T^n$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-predicate-typed","aliases":["91-df-truth-predicate-typed"],"display":"df-truth-predicate-typed — 类型真理谓词 $T^n$","depends_on":["[[91-df-typed-language]]","[[91-df-type-index]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-predicate-typed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-predicate-typed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-predicate-typed — 类型真理谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19dd1f8599ff0195\" href=\"?note=19dd1f8599ff0195\" title=\"91-df-type-index\">91-df-type-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\\)</span> (类型化语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}\\)</span> (第n层句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}^1\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}^1\\)</span> (第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层语言的一元谓词符号集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}typed}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left(\nT^n\\in\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^{n+1}}^1\n\\setminus\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^1\n\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}typed}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left(\nT^n\\in\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^{n+1}}^1\n\\setminus\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^1\n\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_{n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TSch}_{n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> : 第n层真理谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}}^1\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}}^1\\)</span> : 一元谓词符号集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}\\)</span> : 第n层语言句子集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{TSch}_n\\)</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层谓词的许可 T-双条件实例集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：类型真理谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span>是第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层的真理判断符号。其作用域严格限制为第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层或更低层语言的句子。</p>\n<p>关键性质：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>T-schema作用域</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span>的T-schema仅对<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}\\)</span>有效</li>\n<li><strong>禁止同层 T-模式</strong>：含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 的句子不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T^n\">\\(\\mathcal L_T^n\\)</span>，因此没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}_n\\)</span> 实例</li>\n<li><strong>层间关系</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{n+1}\">\\(T^{n+1}\\)</span>可以判断<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span>（因为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n &lt; n+1\">\\(n &lt; n+1\\)</span>）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>示例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner 2+2=4\\urcorner})\">\\(T^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner 2+2=4\\urcorner})\\)</span> 是良式，并有第 0 层模式实例。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\">\\(T^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n仍可句法良构，但没有第 0 层 T-模式实例。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^1(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\">\\(T^1(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n有第 1 层许可实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这里的上标属于谓词符号名称；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ebf36f4bba071548\" href=\"?note=ebf36f4bba071548\" title=\"91-df-truth-iteration\">91-df-truth-iteration</a> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\\varphi\">\\(T^n\\varphi\\)</span>\n表示同一谓词的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次迭代，两种记号须由上下文区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-type-index","status":"resolved","id":"19dd1f8599ff0195","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-type-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}$ (类型化语言, see [[91-df-typed-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"ebf36f4bba071548","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里的上标属于谓词符号名称；[[91-df-truth-iteration]] 中 $T^n\\varphi$\n表示同一谓词的 $n$ 次迭代，两种记号须由上下文区分。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}^1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}typed}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left(\nT^n\\in\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^{n+1}}^1\n\\setminus\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^1\n\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_{n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}}^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"n < n+1","display":false},{"tex":"T^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner 2+2=4\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T^1(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT^0(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T^n\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2198,"backlinks":[{"id":"41d9670193aa08f6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate-typed]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-co